<h3>6d. Competitive acquisition playbooks</h3>
<p>Ordered by conversion share to Simplii. <strong>High retention risk at a source bank does not equal high conversion flow to Simplii.</strong> Scotiabank's retention risk is 43% (highest), but only 10% of Simplii's base comes from Scotiabank. Simplii needs to go where buyers are actually moving.</p>

