<p>Retention at Simplii is not a loyalty management problem; it is a trade-off acceptance management problem. 68% of Simplii customers in the sample are contingent stayers and 32% are retention risk; zero are stable loyalists under the strict definition. That is a structural feature of the no-fee model, not a performance gap. This section translates the segmentation into concrete retention plays.</p>

<h3>7a. Satisfaction drivers</h3>
